// Compatibility rollout: retain legacy translation for a missing new summary.
// The explicit strict-mode run still diagnoses the unresolved contract.
// A passing positive run is compilation/placement evidence, not a device or
// whole-function safety certificate. The original non-sync body is unchanged.
// RUN: ptoas --pto-arch=a3 --enable-insert-sync %s -o - 2>&1 | FileCheck %s --implicit-check-not='#define PIPE_FIX' --implicit-check-not='pto/comm/pto_comm_inst.hpp'
// REJECT: InsertSync unsupported effect: write has no translated storage/pipeline summary
